      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The API is broken as hell after friday's changes. The website displays incongruous statuses (including for yourself) and changes seem to not be properly propagated to wherever they're being cached or sent from in such a way that results often lack internal consistency for hours. People who are online appear offline and people who are offline appear online complete with all location fields, and this swings back and forth without user interaction. The website and the client show different information. The friends list is even more unreliable than in the previous version with \"mitigations\". It doesn't seem honest for the new status page to claim that everything is fully operational.\nhttps://gist.github.com/Protected/2430e93ff56f820900a6ca06c69b0ff1",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
